# device_gap_resume_child_huge_dies: 0x1028 = 0xffffffff: the resume logs that the index is past maxFIFOCount, clears bit 63 of the fault mask (1 << n shifts by n mod 64 on arm64), reports the waits (the FIFO is not faulted), and resumes nothing: past the 64 slots there is no FIFO, as for n = 65 (fifo_child_resume_65_dies). The device runs on; the name is kept from when the host died there.
